467		Let $C\geq1$, $a>1$, and $0<b<1$. Suppose that
468		\[
469			\delta_G=a(md)^a\bigl(\eps^b+q^{-b}+2^{-bmd}\bigr),
470			\qquad
471			\delta_P=C\left(\delta_G+\sqrt{\eps}+\frac{md}{q}\right),
472		\]
473		and set $\delta_{\mathrm{ext}}=C(\delta_P^{1/4}+md/q)$. There are constants
474		$a'\geq1$ and $0<b'<1$, depending only on $C,a,b$, such that, for every
475		admissible $(q,m,d)$ and every $0\leq\eps\leq1$,
476		\[
477			\delta_{\mathrm{ext}}
478			\leq a'(md)^{a'}\bigl(\eps^{b'}+q^{-b'}+2^{-b'md}\bigr).
479		\]
